itics/more-than-40-states-sue-meta-claiming-its-social-platforms-are-addictive-and-harm-childrens-mental-health","line":92},{"title":"Talk Saves Lives","target":"https://afsp.org/talk-saves-lives","line":112},{"title":"*nhassanein@stateline.org*","target":"mailto:nhassanein@stateline.org","line":136}],"metadata":{"title":"Rise in US preteen suicide rate alarms mental health experts • Stateline","source":"https://stateline.org/2026/07/28/rise-in-us-preteen-suicide-rate-alarms-mental-health-experts/","author":["[[Nada Hassanein]]"],"published":"2026-07-28","created":"2026-07-31","description":"The number of preteens — ages 8 to 12 — who die by suicide in the United States each year is relatively small. But the total in 2025 was 194 — the most since at least 2001, according to preliminary data from the federal Centers for Disease Control and Prevention."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},